---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About" description="About xykonnn — VFX wrangler, GM, vibe-coder.">
  <div class="about-page container">

    <header class="about-header">
      <h1>About</h1>
      <div class="ornament-rule" style="max-width: 200px; margin-top: 20px;">
        <span class="line"></span>
        <span class="diamond"></span>
        <span class="line"></span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="about-body">
      <p>
        I'm a VFX on-set technician and wrangler based in Prague, working on international productions.
        When I'm not on set I run Pathfinder 2e campaigns and occasionally build tools to make that easier.
      </p>
      <p>
        Most of the projects here started as personal itch-scratching — something I needed that didn't exist,
        or existed but not quite right. Built with AI assistance and enough code knowledge to steer it properly.
      </p>
      <p>
        The PF2e tools in particular exist because running games generates a surprising number of small
        logistical problems that software can solve.
      </p>

      <div class="section-label" style="margin-top: 40px;"><h3>Elsewhere</h3></div>
      <ul class="links">
        <li><a href="https://github.com/xykonnn" target="_blank">GitHub</a> — code</li>
        <li><a href="https://gamemasternotes.com" target="_blank">Game Master Notes</a> — campaign notes &amp; GM references</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .about-page {
    max-width: 580px;
    padding-top: 60px;
    padding-bottom: 80px;
    animation: fadeUp 0.4s ease both;
  }
  .about-header {
    margin-bottom: 44px;
  }
  .about-header h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }
  .about-body p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: #3a2e24;
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .links {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }
  .links li {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    font-weight: 300;
  }
  .links a {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 400;
  }
</style>
